  "hints": [
    "dedup only collapses adjacent duplicate elements.",
    "pop removes the last element of the vector after sorting and deduplicating."
  ],
  "explanation": "dedup() only removes consecutive duplicates, so sort() must run first to group identical items together. pop() then removes the final and largest element from the deduplicated list before returning values."
